(: A personal view, offered (

    I am just sharing my personal point of view. Implicitly and explicitly I am always sharing my individuated Sammā view. It's just what I feel and think. I am not enforcing it on you, and I do not want you to mindlessly embody it and lose the natural, sharp and discerning clarity of your view. But I would love if you could see from my perspective a little sometimes. Sometimes I say what I think and feel, and its a little too wild, spiritual, natural, and intense for your view, and in these situations historically you have been shocked, terrified, and refuse to even consider my view as real. So now I invite you when you feel the draw or pull to reject my animist ideas, or the idea that you need to assert cynical, skeptical or rationalist materalist views to "Defend normal reality", please take a moment to consider what I am (:! Actually !:) saying.

) End A personal view, offered :) Many blessings
